  "text": "Case note: Complaint No. 763/2022\nClient: Abhishek Bansal (taxi driver, Ahmedabad)\nOpposing party: Shetty Technologies Pvt Ltd\nCourt: Ahmedabad Labour Court\nFiled on: 5 July 2022\nClaim amount: Rs 21,40,000\nIssue: wrongful termination. The dismissal followed a one-sided domestic enquiry.\nAdvice given: Demand the domestic enquiry report and challenge it for breach of natural justice.\nOutcome: The enquiry was set aside for breach of natural justice.\nRecommended next step: Attend the fresh enquiry.\nWitness: Vikram Khan",
